        "method": [
          "Take the chicken out of the fridge an hour before and heat the oven to 200C.",
          "Rub the bird with oil, salt and pepper and tuck the garlic and thyme inside.",
          "Roast for 1 hour 30 minutes, basting once or twice.",
          "Parboil the potatoes, shake them rough and roast in hot oil for the last hour.",
          "Rest the chicken under foil for 20 minutes while you make gravy from the tin and the stock.",
          "Carve at the table and take the credit."
